  "notes": "Psychedelic trap. Sparse hats, hard 808-locked kicks, and a snare on 3 drenched in short reverb; the 808 is cavernous and slides into section downbeats. ⚠ `anticipationProb` raised to 0.15. With `mirror_kick` against a fully locked 808 both parts take every kick, so every bass onset lands exactly on an 808 onset — `coherence.rs` calls that one line played twice rather than two parts locking. The lock is the style and is untouched; the anticipation is what makes them two parts.",
